id: IAC-SEC-021
ilities: [integrity]
source: cpm
maturity: 2
action: block
title: Terraform unencrypted database/storage
category: security
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .tf .hcl
  exclude_paths: test/
patterns:
  - regex: storage_encrypted\s*=\s*false
    message: "RDS storage encryption disabled — violates GDPR, SOC2, PCI-DSS, HIPAA"
  - regex: encrypted\s*=\s*false
    message: "EBS/storage encryption disabled — data at rest unprotected"
  - regex: kms_key_id\s*=\s*""
    message: "Empty KMS key — resource may fall back to no encryption"
fix: Set storage_encrypted = true (RDS), encrypted = true (EBS), and specify a KMS key.
